      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753401600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "T+30s\nCLIENT 1 WAKES, WRITES TOO\n\nUnaware any time passed. Still believes it holds the lock. Writes to the same resource.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "T+30s\nCLIENT 1 WAKES, WRITES TOO\n\nUnaware any time passed. Still believes it holds the lock. Writes to the same resource.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b_callout",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 1130,
      "height": 145,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9d174d",
      "backgroundColor": "#fdf2f8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [{ "id": "t_callout", "type": "text" }],
      "updated": 1753401600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "t_callout",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 335,
      "width": 1090,
      "height": 115,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753401600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE GAP\nRedlock's quorum — 3 of 5 independent nodes, no shared state between them — stops a crashed node from forging a second grant. It does nothing about a live client that pauses past its own lease and wakes up unaware, because the lock is a yes/no. It never hands out a number that increases with each acquisition, so the resource being written to can't tell a stale write from a fresh one.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE GAP\nRedlock's quorum — 3 of 5 independent nodes, no shared state between them — stops a crashed node from forging a second grant. It does nothing about a live client that pauses past its own lease and wakes up unaware, because the lock is a yes/no. It never hands out a number that increases with each acquisition, so the resource being written to can't tell a stale write from a fresh one.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "e_footnote",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 1130,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0f766e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753401600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "antirez: the elapsed-time check happens during acquisition — it catches slow handshakes, not pauses after the lease is granted. Kleppmann: without a fencing token, the resource has no way to reject the stale write. Both right. Neither backed down on whether Redlock itself needed to change.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "antirez: the elapsed-time check happens during acquisition — it catches slow handshakes, not pauses after the lease is granted. Kleppmann: without a fencing token, the resource has no way to reject the stale write. Both right. Neither backed down on whether Redlock itself needed to change.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
